## Why This Is Asked
This tests practical data ingestion and governance basics for beginners in a real-world lake.

## Key Concepts
- Glue Crawlers, Glue ETL, Parquet, partitioning
- Data quality checks, schema evolution
- CloudWatch/SNS for monitoring, end-to-end testing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: quick data quality check sketch
function checkNullRate(records){
  const total = records.length;
  const nulls = records.filter(r=> Object.values(r).includes(null)).length;
  return (nulls/total) < 0.05;
}
```

